afia utilizando uma tinta condutora de carbono. Os sensores foram empregados para detectar \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"language:pt-BR\">carbendazim\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"language:pt-BR\">, \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"language:pt-BR\">diurom\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"language:pt-BR\">, \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"language:pt-BR\">paraquate\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"language:pt-BR\"> e \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"language:pt-BR\">feniltrotiona\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"language:pt-BR\"> em amostras de maçã, couve e suco de laranja utilizando técnicas eletroquímica\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:8.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#3f3f3f\">\u003Cspan style=\"fon